<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fermentation</i>, Herasap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.1044
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>lewdness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				20.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>boiling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδοὺς ζέμα</span>
			bringing it to <i>the boil</i>, Herasap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.548
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δὸς ζέμα</span> keep it on
				<i>the boil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				113
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνις ἀπὸ ζέματος</span> a
				<i>boiled</i> fowl, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>that which is boiled, decoction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				8.37.3
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέμμα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				24.13
			</span></i>.</div>
